WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:05.500
We are performing an IPL for GPC 1.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
First step: Load the bootstrap loader, FCMBOOT.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
FCMBOOT then loads the GPCIPL program.

00:38.000 --> 00:45.000
The GPCIPL program prepares to load PASS (OPS-000).

01:07.000 --> 01:12.000
We're now running PASS in OPS-0, the System Software

01:20.000 --> 01:30.000
We're now configuring the databuses ...

01:40.000 --> 01:44.000
When that's done, we'll want to transition to OPS-1.

01:44.500 --> 01:49.000
But we can't go directly from OPS-0 to OPS-1.

01:49.050 --> 01:54.500
We have to first go to OPS-9, and then to OPS-1.

02:13.000 --> 02:18.000
In OPS-9 now, using more of the control panel than OPS-0.

02:18.500 --> 02:23.500
We can now transition to OPS-1, which takes quite a while,

02:24.000 --> 02:29.000
and indeed, temporarily take us back through OPS-0 ...

02:53.000 --> 02:58.000
And we're finally in OPS-1 (Ascent), using even more of the control panel.
